module transaction_memory_commit
lineage L_A
agent A lineage L_A
begin_transaction autobiographical_commit
observe episode by A content "episode-42" confidence 0.96
proof p_access access episode by A
proof p_origin origin episode source A lineage L_A
proof p_clear clear episode for A
proof p_obs observation episode by A
proof p_own ownership episode by A as observed from ["p_access","p_origin","p_clear","p_obs"]
write_memory episode by A as observed requires p_own
commit_transaction autobiographical_commit
assert memory A contains episode as observed true
